  description: Persistent namespace of the WebSemantic ontology (w3id.org)
abstract: 'Semantic framework for preparing scientific simulation scenarios, validating
  typed configurations and qualifying numerical outputs with explicit provenance.
  One descriptor per software is compiled into an LLM contract, an ontology with SHACL shapes and FAIR
  metadata; three unchanged backends are linked at pinned revisions (TLS, LQL-Equiv, pyrcel).
  Outputs are synthetic and have not been validated against field measurements.

  '
